00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:11,140
The hotel has a stable with beautiful stallions for a very romantic horseback ride along the country trail.

232
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:15,420
You can also go fishing at the nearby lake or visit the local vineyard.

233
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,460
I'm sold.

234
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,040
I want to book this trip.

235
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,040
I don't care what it costs.

236
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,740
Money is no object.

237
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:30,240
All right, so talking about getaways.

238
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:36,840
Now the sales agent offered him options such as beach, wilderness, countryside, or even a spa.

239
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:38,080
Which one do you prefer?

240
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:39,060
Wilderness.

241
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:39,780
For sure.

242
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,840
You want to go into the forest, the jungle.

243
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,820
Yes, I hate to say it.

244
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,880
I think beaches are boring.

245
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:47,260
Sorry, mom.

246
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,720
I know you love beaches.

247
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,080
I like to do stuff when I'm away.

248
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:54,660
I love the desert too, but the wilderness, somewhere where I'm outside.

249
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,740
I live in a city.

250
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:57,720
I don't want to go to a city.

251
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:01,880
I like to go somewhere where I can walk around, hike, ride a bike, do things like that.

252
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:02,760
What about you?

253
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:07,080
I actually don't have a favorite, actually.

254
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,800
Sometimes it's nice for me to go to the beach and relax.

255
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:14,020
I do tend to get a little bit bored after maybe two days of doing nothing on the beach.

256
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:21,480
But it does give a good opportunity to do other things, beach activities like snorkeling or scuba diving, which can also be really fun.

257
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:29,660
But definitely I do enjoy the wilderness as well, the jungle and rafting or camping.

258
00:16:30,290 --> 00:16:30,950
It's good fun.

259
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:35,470
The insects can be a bit of a nuisance at times.

260
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:36,410
Or the rain.

261
00:16:36,810 --> 00:16:37,290
Or the rain.

262
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:41,640
Getting in the snow or the rain is so horrible.

263
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:42,880
But other than that, yeah, it's great.

264
00:16:43,030 --> 00:16:47,550
I know not many people enjoy these types of outdoor getaways.

265
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:50,660
But of course, you have spas.

266
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:53,840
I know many people enjoy going to a spa, having a mud bath.

267
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,160
Nothing wrong with that.

268
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,780
Getting your nails done, having a massage.

269
00:16:57,920 --> 00:17:01,080
Getting the whole royal treatment, like we say.

270
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,740
So this is what we want to know now.

271
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:05,840
When you go on vacation, what do you like to do?

272
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:08,990
Do you like to get away to the tropical beaches?

273
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:11,690
Do you like to go to the islands or the jungle?

274
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,120
What do you like to do?

275
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:13,450
Let us know.

276
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,520
Our website is EnglishPod.com.

277
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:16,230
We hope to see you there.

278
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:16,650
All right.

279
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:18,520
We'll see you guys next time.

280
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:19,520
Bye.
